{"availability":"available","full":"ironbee-ai/ironbee-express","name":"ironbee-express","description":"The fastest, cheapest browser agent (with Jev), with deep reasoning when it matters","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":11,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T09:59:58Z","updated":"2026-10-01T09:07:31Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://ironbee.ai","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z","stars":11,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The fastest, cheapest browser agent, with deep reasoning when it matters.","It checks whether your app really did what the page says, and when it didn't, finds the root cause.","The IronBee Express waitlist is open. Get early access to IronBee Express on the IronBee platform. Join the waitlist →"],"features":["Fastest and cheapest. There is no LLM in the loop by default. Each step is a single Jev choice","It reviews the whole run and finds the root cause. If the page says \"Order placed successfully!\"","Record once, replay. A passing run of a scenario is cached and replayed without engine","Secrets are not shown to models. Passwords and tokens are typed by reference; neither the engine","Hands over to a person when needed. For a social login, a CAPTCHA or an SMS code, the run pauses,"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"04b47dc5f24c9a4909044aa5d113b74fd0ff25712299d8ceb42751569f8344a4","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:36:20.183Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.921Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The fastest, cheapest browser agent, with deep reasoning when it matters.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A real run at 1× speed: from sign-in to a completed order, 9 actions in 6.7 s.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You describe the task in one sentence, for example \"Log in, add the iPhone 15 Pro to the cart, then open the cart\", and it carries it out in a real browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"You need Node.js 22+, Google Chrome and a TypeSafe API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"04b47dc5f24c9a4909044aa5d113b74fd0ff25712299d8ceb42751569f8344a4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.922Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T09:07:31Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:42.854Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ironbee-ai/ironbee-express/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:49:49.923Z","hash":"04b47dc5f24c9a4909044aa5d113b74fd0ff25712299d8ceb42751569f8344a4","originalBytes":23426,"storedBytes":23426,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["run","ironbee","text","page","api","goal","docs","jev","failed","password","act","browser","model","one","decide","key","only","npm","scenario","when","backend","click","done","engine","order","add","secrets","start","button","dev","every","login","value","actions","cart","controls","demo","how","ibexpress","name","each","examples","express","logs","over","review","shows","what","about","after","checkout","evidence","it.","log","press","recording","saved","scenarios","secret","cli","decisions","devtools","e-shop","env","needs","never","next","once","person","remove","runs","says","sign","step","tab","turn","without","code","connect","do